  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 4 and takes 60 minutes to prepare and 20 minutes to cook. Tiny parcels of spiced lamb are sealed inside thin egg-pasta dough, boiled until tender and piled into bowls with garlicky yoghurt spooned over and a sizzled paprika butter poured on top at the last moment."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: the smaller the manti, the better the ratio of filling to dough, and the more impressive the result. Aim for squares no bigger than 3cm. It takes patience but the texture is completely different from larger versions."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
